  "description": "Aki7777777's SparseRef15 Hybrid, Pruned Partial-INT8 V1.0: FL2VA with a sparse Ref2VA influence in 15 blocks, built for character consistency without losing FL2VA motion. One 21 GB checkpoint on the official 20-step graphs. MEASURED 2026-09-10 on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti, vanilla ComfyUI 0.34.3, against the official pruned int8 checkpoint on the same graph, seed, prompt and settings (864x480, 5 s, 20 steps res_multistep/simple, no Spectrum/Sage). Face crop sharpness 396 vs 243 (+63%), stillest static shot, most motion in the moving shot, same ~200 s per clip. Text and image to video only: it is not a native Ref2VA model, and its long-form identity claim is untested on our side, so no reference card until it is.",
  "tags": [
    "Local",
    "Video",
    "T2V",
